					<h1>Finalist Award Winner</h1>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Name:</strong> Brooke</li>
						<li><strong>Age:</strong> 9</li>
						<li><strong>Award:</strong> Mia&#8217;s Starter Collection</li>
						<li><strong>Nominated by:</strong> Her mother, Jamie</li>
					</ul>
